@slim: 1.0
@+desc: Summarize all changes in current branch vs main.
@+allowed-tools: Bash, Read, Glob, Grep

Read all files changed in current branch vs main. Summarize:
1. Features added or modified
2. Breaking changes introduced
3. Files that might need additional tests
4. Areas needing documentation updates
5. Current state of work

Help me understand where we left off.
